1
00:00:21,28 --> 00:00:23,34
Monica?
摩妮卡？

2
00:00:24,69 --> 00:00:25,88
What time is it?
現在幾點？

3
00:00:26,42 --> 00:00:27,58
Nine.
9點

4
00:00:30,03 --> 00:00:31,32
But it's dark out.
可是外面還很黑

5
00:00:32,06 --> 00:00:35,72
That's because you always sleep till noon,silly.
那是因為你老睡到中午，傻瓜

6
00:00:36,06 --> 00:00:38,36
This is what nine looks like.
9點就是這麼黑

7
00:00:39,70 --> 00:00:41,93
I guess I'll get washed up then.
那我該梳洗一下

8
00:00:42,50 --> 00:00:44,06
Watch that sunrise.
準備看日出

9
00:00:47,28 --> 00:00:50,07
I'm getting tired of always sneaking around.
我不想再偷偷摸摸了

10
00:00:50,28 --> 00:00:54,67
Me too. What if we went away for the weekend? No interruptions.
我知道，我也是 不然我們去外面渡週末 就沒人打擾我們

12
00:00:54,78 --> 00:00:56,77
We could be naked the entire time.
還可以赤身裸體

13
00:00:57,42 --> 00:01:00,35
All weekend? That's a whole lot of naked.
整個週末？那可是很長

14
00:01:01,06 --> 00:01:04,92
I'll say I have a conference and you can have a chef thing.
我可以說我去開會 你就說去參加廚師研討

15
00:01:05,13 --> 00:01:08,12
I wanted to go to this culinary fair in Jersey!
我一直想參加澤西的烹飪大會

16
00:01:08,36 --> 00:01:10,46
Okay. You know you're not,though.
不過你去的不是那裡

17
00:01:11,77 --> 00:01:13,43
-Let's go. -Okay. Wait.
走吧

18
00:01:13,70 --> 00:01:15,07
What about Joey?
等等，喬伊怎麼辦？

19
00:01:23,18 --> 00:01:25,37
The One with the Kips
本集播出：「誰進誰出」

20
00:01:26,71 --> 00:01:27,44
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

21
00:02:11,19 --> 00:02:15,13
I'm going to a culinary fair in Jersey this weekend.
你們知道我這週末要幹嘛嗎？去紐澤西參加烹飪大會

23
00:02:15,36 --> 00:02:19,03
How weird! Chandler just said he's got a conference there.
錢德剛才說要去那裡開會

24
00:02:20,87 --> 00:02:24,70
That's funny. Seems like Chandler's conference could've been...
真有意思 錢德應該可以 

26
00:02:24,94 --> 00:02:26,63
...in Connecticut or Vermont.
去康州或維蒙開會

27
00:02:28,94 --> 00:02:32,21
I'm not in charge of where the conference is held.
我又不能決定在哪裡開會

28
00:02:32,61 --> 00:02:36,57
Do you want people to think it's fake? It's a real conference.
難道你希望大家認為我造假？ 因為我可沒說謊

29
00:02:38,79 --> 00:02:41,58
-ls Rachel here? -No,she's out shopping.
瑞秋在嗎？我要找她 
她出去逛街了

31
00:02:42,12 --> 00:02:44,11
-Damn! -What's going on?
可惡 怎麼了？ 

33
00:02:45,33 --> 00:02:46,82
I told Emily to come.
我叫艾蜜莉來

34
00:02:47,06 --> 00:02:51,26
And I just need to,you know, talk to Rachel about it.
所以我得趕快跟瑞秋說

35
00:02:52,63 --> 00:02:54,12
Wait a minute.
等等

36
00:02:54,34 --> 00:02:57,57
When Emily comes, you won't see Rachel anymore?
艾蜜莉來了之後 你真的就不見瑞秋了？

37
00:02:57,71 --> 00:03:00,87
I'm focusing on the "I get to see my wife" part...
我現在只能專心想著 「我可以見我老婆」

38
00:03:01,08 --> 00:03:03,98
...and not on the part that makes me do this.
不去想我快胃潰瘍的事

39
00:03:07,05 --> 00:03:09,61
So you'll never be in a room together?
你們再也不能共處一室？

40
00:03:09,82 --> 00:03:11,51
How will that even work?
這怎麼可能？

41
00:03:11,75 --> 00:03:13,58
I have no idea. I mean....
我也不知道

42
00:03:13,82 --> 00:03:16,88
But I assure you, I will figure it out.
但是我一定會想到辦法

43
00:03:19,26 --> 00:03:21,49
It doesn't seem like it'll work.
看起來實在不可能…

44
00:03:23,67 --> 00:03:24,86
Hi,guys.
大家好 嗨

45
00:03:24,87 --> 00:03:26,27
嘿

46
00:03:26,43 --> 00:03:27,49
What's going on?
怎麼了？

47
00:03:28,67 --> 00:03:31,00
We're flipping Monica's mattress.
我們正要幫摩妮卡翻床墊

48
00:03:33,61 --> 00:03:37,67
So I'm thinking,basically, we pick it up and then we flip it.
我認為應該先抬起來再翻過來

49
00:03:39,61 --> 00:03:41,28
That's better than my way.
這方法比我的主意好

50
00:03:43,05 --> 00:03:45,58
Hey guys,would you flip mine too?
你們順便幫我翻

51
00:03:45,89 --> 00:03:47,41
Oh,man.
受不了

52
00:03:50,73 --> 00:03:53,25
Oh,look! A letter from my mom.
我媽寄信來

53
00:03:55,13 --> 00:03:56,93
So,Rach?
瑞秋，

54
00:03:57,87 --> 00:04:00,06
You know how Emily's coming?
你知道艾蜜莉要來

55
00:04:00,27 --> 00:04:01,90
Oh,yeah. I know.
我知道啊

56
00:04:02,24 --> 00:04:03,76
Can you hear anything?
聽得到嗎？

57
00:04:03,97 --> 00:04:06,96
Yeah,somebody just said, "Can you hear anything?"
當然，剛剛有人說 「聽得到嗎？」

58
00:04:11,98 --> 00:04:14,11
Hey,Joey's ass.
喬伊的大屁股

59
00:04:16,58 --> 00:04:17,57
What are you doing?
你在做什麼？

60
00:04:17,82 --> 00:04:20,22
Remember when they fought and broke up...
記得上次他們吵架分手時 

61
00:04:20,42 --> 00:04:23,48
...and we were stuck here all night with no food?
我們卡在房裡沒東西可吃嗎？

62
00:04:23,73 --> 00:04:27,99
When Ross said "Rachel" at the wedding, I figured it'd happen again.
羅斯在婚禮上說出瑞秋名字後 我猜舊戲可能會重演

63
00:04:28,50 --> 00:04:30,26
So I hid this in here.
所以我在這裡藏了這些東西

64
00:04:30,83 --> 00:04:33,06
Candy bars,crossword puzzles....
有糖果，猜謎…

65
00:04:33,27 --> 00:04:35,13
Mad Libs! Mine!
還有瘋狂字謎，我要

66
00:04:36,80 --> 00:04:39,50
-Okay,"Name of someone in room."
-Chandler.
好，「說出房裡某人的名字」
錢德

67
00:04:40,24 --> 00:04:42,40
Come on,seriously.
拜託，正經一點

69
00:04:44,55 --> 00:04:47,54
What do you got in here? Magazines,Doritos
還有什麼？雜誌、洋芋片

70
00:04:47,68 --> 00:04:49,58
Condoms?
保險套？

71
00:04:51,35 --> 00:04:54,19
You don't know how long we'll be in here.
誰曉得會在這裡待多久

72
00:04:54,52 --> 00:04:56,58
We may have to repopulate the Earth.
搞不好我們還得負責 繁衍人類後代

73
00:04:58,93 --> 00:05:01,72
And condoms are the way to do that?
戴保險套還想繁衍後代？

74
00:05:03,80 --> 00:05:07,29
Anyway,it all boils down to this.
有個關鍵問題

75
00:05:07,64 --> 00:05:12,16
-The last time I talked to Emily -Oh,my God! Our dog died!
上次我跟艾蜜莉通電話 天啊，我的狗死了

77
00:05:13,17 --> 00:05:17,01
-What? -Oh,my God! LaPooh,our dog!
什麼？ 天啊，拉普死了

79
00:05:19,78 --> 00:05:22,51
LaPooh's still alive?
拉普還活著？

80
00:05:24,42 --> 00:05:26,39
Sorry.
對不起

81
00:05:26,52 --> 00:05:31,25
It says he was hit by an ice cream truck and dragged for...
我媽說它被冰淇淋車撞到

83
00:05:31,53 --> 00:05:33,65
...nineteen blocks!
還被拖了...19條街

84
00:05:35,83 --> 00:05:38,77
-Oh,my God. -Sweetie,we heard you crying.
我的天啊 我們聽到你在哭

86
00:05:39,03 --> 00:05:41,83
-Please don't cry. -It's LaPooh!
別哭了

87
00:05:42,14 --> 00:05:45,44
I know,it's LaPooh right now but it'll get better.
是拉普 過幾天就沒事了

89
00:05:52,28 --> 00:05:54,44
I can't believe it! We're here!
不可思議，我們到了

90
00:05:55,85 --> 00:05:58,51
Chocolates on the pillows! I love that!
枕頭上還放巧克力 我最愛這套

91
00:05:58,72 --> 00:06:01,62
You should live with Joey. Rolos everywhere.
那你應該跟喬伊住 到處都有巧克力糖

92
00:06:02,69 --> 00:06:05,35
This is so great. No one's gonna bother us.
太好了，沒人會來打擾我們

93
00:06:05,49 --> 00:06:07,26
And we're gonna do it.
我們可以盡情纏綿

94
00:06:07,40 --> 00:06:09,99
I'm gonna do it with Monica!
我要跟摩妮卡上床了

95
00:06:11,87 --> 00:06:15,13
Chandler,stop yelling that you and I are gonna do it!
錢德，上床就上床，別窮嚷嚷

97
00:06:16,24 --> 00:06:17,90
-I'll be right back. -Okay.
我馬上回來

99
00:06:23,41 --> 00:06:24,78
Oh,yes!
萬歲

100
00:06:25,65 --> 00:06:28,58
Get in here. There's a high-speed car chase on!
摩妮卡快來 電視正在轉播警匪公路追逐戰

101
00:06:28,98 --> 00:06:30,61
We're switching rooms.
我們要換房間

102
00:06:30,95 --> 00:06:33,55
Oh,dear God! They gave us glasses!
天啊，他們給了我們玻璃杯！

103
00:06:34,12 --> 00:06:36,56
The glasses have lipstick on them.
杯子上有口紅印

104
00:06:36,79 --> 00:06:39,28
Who knows what else they didn't change?
如果連杯子都沒換 誰曉得還有哪些東西沒換

105
00:06:39,43 --> 00:06:42,26
You wanna switch rooms because they didn't switch the glasses?
飯店沒換杯子你就要換房間？

106
00:06:42,40 --> 00:06:46,13
I didn't wanna say anything, but the carpet smells too.
我本來不想說 地毯也有點臭

107
00:06:47,10 --> 00:06:52,44
I want this weekend to be perfect. We can change rooms,can't we?
親愛的，我只是希望 過個完美的週末 換個房間嘛

109
00:06:53,07 --> 00:06:57,07
Okay,but let's do it now. Chopper Five just lost its feed!
好吧，要換快換 5號直升機剛跟丟了

111
00:07:11,79 --> 00:07:13,59
Forget it.
算了

112
00:07:19,23 --> 00:07:23,97
You know how there was something I wanted to talk to you about?
記得我上次有事告訴你嗎？

113
00:07:24,14 --> 00:07:25,30
Oh,yeah.
對

115
00:07:28,11 --> 00:07:31,34
I'm trying to work things out with Emily.
你知道我很希望跟艾蜜莉合好

116
00:07:32,95 --> 00:07:34,28
Well,there's this...
不過…

117
00:07:34,52 --> 00:07:36,45
...one thing.
有件事...

119
00:07:39,52 --> 00:07:41,08
Here goes.
我要說了

120
00:07:44,19 --> 00:07:45,63
I made a promise that
我答應她…

121
00:07:46,53 --> 00:07:48,36
-What? -Your nose is bleeding.
什麼？ 你流鼻血

122
00:07:48,63 --> 00:07:51,12
-Oh,God! -You're bleeding.
天啊

123
00:07:51,37 --> 00:07:55,03
Oh,not again. This happened when my grandfather died.
別又來了 我祖父過世時也一樣

125
00:07:55,50 --> 00:07:56,60
Sorry.
實在是…抱歉

126
00:07:57,31 --> 00:07:58,47
Gross.

127
00:07:58,67 --> 00:08:02,13
Okay. So I'm sorry. What did you want to tell me?
好了，對不起 你剛要說什麼？

128
00:08:10,28 --> 00:08:11,65
Sorry. Sorry.
抱歉

130
00:08:16,62 --> 00:08:18,52
I can't see you anymore.
我不能再見你了

131
00:08:18,86 --> 00:08:22,66
I know,it's ridiculous. I can't see you,either. All right.
我知道，真離譜 我也看不到你 好吧

132
00:08:22,80 --> 00:08:26,82
I'm just gonna go shove a bunch of tissues in my nose.
我得塞一坨衛生紙到鼻子裡

134
00:08:26,97 --> 00:08:30,20
Hey,do you wanna tell me while I do that?
我邊塞你邊說好了

135
00:08:30,34 --> 00:08:32,00
I'm good.
算了

136
00:08:34,54 --> 00:08:38,27
-I think you'll like this room more. -Okay,great.
你們可能會喜歡這間房 太好了

137
00:08:41,48 --> 00:08:43,28
They say he's only got half a tank left.
聽說他只剩下一半的汽油

138
00:08:43,42 --> 00:08:48,95
Half a tank? Still lots of high-speed chasing to do!
一半？那還可以跑很久哩

139
00:08:49,09 --> 00:08:52,36
-I'll bet he's heading for Canada. -They always do.
他一定是想去加拿大 每次都用同一招

141
00:08:52,86 --> 00:08:55,39
-We're switching rooms again. -What? Why?
我們必須換房間 什麼？為什麼？

142
00:08:55,56 --> 00:08:58,90
This has a garden view. We paid for an ocean view.
這間房是花園景觀 我們訂的是觀海房

144
00:08:59,13 --> 00:09:03,54
Our last ocean-view room was unacceptable to you.
只剩一間觀海房 可是你們不喜歡

145
00:09:03,97 --> 00:09:06,53
-The carpet smelled. -Like ocean?
那間房的地毯有味道 大海的味道？

147
00:09:07,44 --> 00:09:09,93
No,like feet.
是腳臭味

148
00:09:11,21 --> 00:09:15,15
Excuse me. Can I talk to you over here for just a second?
失陪，我可以跟你談一下嗎？

149
00:09:19,12 --> 00:09:20,25
錢德 來了

150
00:09:21,46 --> 00:09:25,12
These clowns want to take us for a ride. I won't let them.
這些小人想佔我們便宜 我才沒那麼蠢

151
00:09:25,36 --> 00:09:27,29
We're not a couple of suckers.
我們可不是呆頭鵝

152
00:09:28,53 --> 00:09:29,69
I hear you,Mugsy.
說得好，大姐頭

153
00:09:31,13 --> 00:09:33,07
All these rooms are fine.
這些房間都還好啊 

154
00:09:33,30 --> 00:09:35,86
Just pick one so I can watch the
請你趕快選定，讓我看…

155
00:09:36,10 --> 00:09:39,80
Have a perfect,magical weekend together with you?
讓我跟你一起好好渡假

156
00:09:42,94 --> 00:09:45,91
Oh,man,he almost hit a gas truck.
天啊，他差點撞上油罐車

157
00:09:46,05 --> 00:09:48,64
Do you ever watch Baywatch?
你看不看「海灘遊俠」？

158
00:09:55,96 --> 00:09:59,79
-This one I like. -Nothing. Nothing. It's over. Damn it!
我喜歡這間 沒了，結束了

160
00:09:59,93 --> 00:10:02,99
This is regularly scheduled programming!
竟然沒有延長時間

161
00:10:03,13 --> 00:10:07,03
-I wanted to see them talk to his neighbors. -Well,I'm standing right here...
我想看他們訪問鄰居 我就在這

163
00:10:07,17 --> 00:10:10,73
-...you could talk to me. -You didn't know him.
你可以跟我聊天 你又不認識歹徒

164
00:10:11,64 --> 00:10:13,11
Can we turn the TV off?
可以關掉電視嗎？

165
00:10:13,31 --> 00:10:16,07
Do we really want to spend the weekend like this?
難道整個週末都要看電視？

166
00:10:16,24 --> 00:10:19,41
Am I getting in the way of the room-switching fun?
抱歉，我是不是 妨礙你換房間了？

167
00:10:20,35 --> 00:10:22,18
Don't blame me for tonight.
你火大可別怪到我身上 

168
00:10:22,42 --> 00:10:25,51
Who should I blame? The nice bellman?
否則該怪誰？那個倒霉的服務生？

169
00:10:25,79 --> 00:10:28,39
Or the idiot who thought he could drive...
或許該怪那個以為用半箱汽油 

171
00:10:28,42 --> 00:10:31,32
...from Albany to Canada on half a tank of gas?
可以從紐約跑到加拿大的傢伙

172
00:10:32,36 --> 00:10:34,66
Do not speak ill of the dead.
不要說死者的壞話

173
00:10:36,36 --> 00:10:40,36
We're supposed to be spending a romantic weekend together.
我們出來是為了過浪漫週末

174
00:10:40,67 --> 00:10:41,83
What's the matter?
你到底哪裡有毛病？

175
00:10:42,14 --> 00:10:44,66
I just want to watch a little television.
我只是想看點電視 有何不對？

176
00:10:44,87 --> 00:10:46,67
Jeez,relax,Mom.
放輕鬆嘛，老媽

177
00:10:49,68 --> 00:10:50,84
What did you say?
你說什麼？

178
00:10:51,55 --> 00:10:54,71
I said,"Jeez,relax,Mon."
我說，「放輕鬆，小摩」

179
00:10:57,12 --> 00:11:02,61
You know what,Chandler? You like fast getaways? Watch this.
你喜歡看高速逃忘？ 現在就看好了

180
00:11:02,76 --> 00:11:07,35
I don't like fast getaways, I like car chases.
我不喜歡看高速逃忘 我要看的是飛車逃忘

181
00:11:16,60 --> 00:11:19,16
-Hey,what's up? -Hey.
嗨

182
00:11:20,41 --> 00:11:24,71
I've been wanting to tell you something and I just have to get it out.
瑞秋，我一直有話要告訴你 
我非說不可

184
00:11:24,85 --> 00:11:26,40
Okay. What's up?
什麼事？

185
00:11:26,55 --> 00:11:29,04
Okay,before I tell you I just have to know...
在我說話之前，你確定 

186
00:11:29,18 --> 00:11:31,91
...is your nose okay?
不會再流鼻血？

187
00:11:32,09 --> 00:11:35,89
Are all the other family pets in good health?
你家其他的寵物都很健康？

188
00:11:36,02 --> 00:11:39,62
Well,Davey's still pining after LaPooh...
大衛還在傷心拉普過世

189
00:11:39,76 --> 00:11:42,52
...but,you know,he's a tough little turtle.
不過它是支堅強的小烏龜

190
00:11:45,13 --> 00:11:49,30
You know how you said to do whatever it takes to fix my marriage?
你上次說我應該 不惜代價挽救婚姻？

191
00:11:49,47 --> 00:11:52,60
Yeah,I told you to give Emily whatever she wants.
對，我叫你 答應艾蜜莉所有要求

192
00:11:53,74 --> 00:11:58,74
And while that was good advice, you should know that what she wants...
你建議不錯 不過我必須告訴你她開的條件

193
00:12:02,65 --> 00:12:06,59
...is for me not to see you anymore.
就是叫我永遠不能再見你

195
00:12:08,86 --> 00:12:13,69
That's crazy! You can't do that. What are you going to tell her?
太扯了，你才做不到 你要怎麼告訴她？

197
00:12:19,20 --> 00:12:21,03
Oh,my God!
天啊

198
00:12:22,17 --> 00:12:24,33
You've already agreed to this.
你已經答應了 對不對？

199
00:12:25,17 --> 00:12:27,27
It's awful,I know.
我知道自己很惡劣

200
00:12:27,94 --> 00:12:31,67
But I have to do this if I want my marriage to work.
我心情也很糟糕 但是這是挽救婚姻的唯一方法

201
00:12:31,88 --> 00:12:36,32
And I do. I have to make this marriage work. I have to.
我很希望跟她合好 必須挽救這段婚姻

202
00:12:40,96 --> 00:12:45,39
But the good thing is,we can still see each other until she gets here.
好在我們在她抵達之前 還可以繼續見面

203
00:12:48,66 --> 00:12:52,53
Lucky me! Oh,my God! That is good news,Ross!
我真幸運 天啊，這真是好消息

205
00:12:52,73 --> 00:12:56,07
That's the best news I've heard since LaPooh died!
自從拉普過世之後 最大的好消息

206
00:12:58,97 --> 00:13:03,88
You have no idea what a nightmare this has been. This is so hard.
你不知道我有多難過 我也很痛苦

208
00:13:04,21 --> 00:13:06,48
Oh,yeah,really? Is it,Ross?
是嗎？真的嗎，羅斯？

209
00:13:06,68 --> 00:13:10,45
-Let me make this easier for you. -What are you doing?
我可以為你減輕壓力 你做什麼？

210
00:13:10,65 --> 00:13:12,88
-Storming out. -It's your apartment.
憤而出走  瑞秋，這是你家

211
00:13:13,09 --> 00:13:15,58
Yeah? Well,that's how mad I am!
你看我有多火大

213
00:13:28,00 --> 00:13:29,77
Damn Rolos!
臭巧克力糖

214
00:13:31,61 --> 00:13:34,20
You're back! How was your conference?
你回來了 嘿 這次出差如何？

215
00:13:34,44 --> 00:13:38,67
It was terrible. I fought with my colleagues the entire time.
糟透了 我跟…同事吵架 到回來前都沒合好

217
00:13:38,91 --> 00:13:40,68
Are you kidding with this?
你開玩笑？

218
00:13:42,02 --> 00:13:43,75
So your weekend was a bust?
也就是整個週末都泡湯？

219
00:13:43,88 --> 00:13:47,12
No,I got to see Donald Trump waiting for an elevator.
也不會，我看到 唐納川普等電梯

220
00:13:47,25 --> 00:13:52,32
You know,at the Taj Mahal he has his own private glass elevator.
他在泰姬陵有私人玻璃電梯

221
00:13:52,46 --> 00:13:54,95
That's right. Made by Otis Elevators.
都由歐狄斯電梯公司生產

222
00:13:55,10 --> 00:13:57,59
And they don't usually do glass.
那家公司很少做玻璃電梯

223
00:13:58,20 --> 00:14:01,03
What kinds of stuff do you know?
你腦袋裡都裝什麼啊？

224
00:14:03,50 --> 00:14:04,97
You're back too.
嗨 你也回來了

225
00:14:05,27 --> 00:14:07,57
Could I talk to you for a second?
對，錢德，可以出來一下嗎？

227
00:14:07,81 --> 00:14:10,83
-How was your chef thing? -lt was awful.
烹飪大會好玩嗎？ 糟透了

229
00:14:11,08 --> 00:14:13,64
Some people don't appreciate good food.
有些人根本不會欣賞美食

230
00:14:13,91 --> 00:14:16,61
Maybe the food tasted good at first...
你的食物可能看起來很美味

231
00:14:16,85 --> 00:14:19,91
...but then made everybody vomit and have diarrhea.
吃下去卻害人上吐下瀉

232
00:14:22,19 --> 00:14:24,28
錢德 摩妮卡

233
00:14:28,16 --> 00:14:30,46
How much was the room? I'll pay my half.
旅館費用多少？ 我要付我那一半

234
00:14:30,66 --> 00:14:31,69
Fine. $300.
很好，300元

235
00:14:31,97 --> 00:14:32,96
$300?
300元？

236
00:14:33,17 --> 00:14:35,26
Just think of it as $25 per room.
就想成每間25元

237
00:14:39,31 --> 00:14:41,54
What are you guys woofing about?
你們鬼叫什麼？

238
00:14:42,14 --> 00:14:44,54
Chandler stole a 20 from my purse!
錢德從我皮包偷了20元紙鈔

239
00:14:44,85 --> 00:14:46,17
不會吧？

240
00:14:47,35 --> 00:14:50,32
I was only stealing it back, the one that she stole from me.
因為摩妮卡先偷我的錢 我只是拿回來

241
00:14:50,45 --> 00:14:53,58
Stealing and now lying.
這人不但是小偷還說謊

242
00:14:54,12 --> 00:14:56,82
You know what? Now that I think about it...
現在回頭想想，

243
00:14:57,02 --> 00:15:00,15
...I constantly find myself without 20s,and you...
我老沒20元 

244
00:15:00,36 --> 00:15:02,19
...always have lots.
你皮夾裡倒是很多

245
00:15:07,64 --> 00:15:09,90
You should've seen the look on her face.
你們應該看看她當時的表情

246
00:15:10,17 --> 00:15:13,66
I don't want Rachel to hate me. I don't know what to do.
我不希望瑞秋恨我 真不知道該怎麼辦

247
00:15:13,87 --> 00:15:16,00
-You want my advice? -Yes. Please.
你要聽我的建議嗎？請說

248
00:15:16,38 --> 00:15:18,87
-You won't like it. -That's okay.
你聽了一定不高興 沒關係

251
00:15:19,71 --> 00:15:21,98
You got married too fast.
你決定結婚太匆促了

252
00:15:23,58 --> 00:15:25,98
-That's not advice. -I told you.
這算哪們子忠告？ 看吧

253
00:15:29,32 --> 00:15:31,15
I'm going to the bathroom.
我去洗手間

254
00:15:32,89 --> 00:15:37,19
If anyone asked me to give up any of you,I couldn't do it.
要有人叫我別見你們其中一個 我絕對辦不到

255
00:15:37,33 --> 00:15:38,32
Me neither.
我也不行

256
00:15:38,93 --> 00:15:40,26
Maybe I could do it.
或許我可以

257
00:15:44,47 --> 00:15:45,67
嗨 嗨，瑞秋

258
00:15:46,01 --> 00:15:48,77
I know you guys heard about me and Ross.
我知道你們聽說 羅斯跟我的事情了

259
00:15:49,04 --> 00:15:53,45
But I've been obsessing about it and would love not to talk about it.
我已經煩了一整天 請你們別再提起了

260
00:15:53,71 --> 00:15:56,77
I don't know if this falls under that category...
我不知道這算不算提起

261
00:15:57,02 --> 00:15:59,11
...but Ross is right back there.
不過羅斯就在後面

262
00:15:59,79 --> 00:16:02,02
-That's not Ross. -Not that guy.
那才不是羅斯

263
00:16:02,22 --> 00:16:04,05
He does look like him,though.
不是那個，雖然很像

264
00:16:05,59 --> 00:16:07,36
Ross is in the bathroom.
羅斯去洗手間了

265
00:16:07,63 --> 00:16:11,56
Oh,my God! It's happening. It's already started. I'm Kip.
天啊，開始了，現在就這樣， 我就像阿吉

267
00:16:12,30 --> 00:16:13,93
Yeah,you're not Kip.
你才不是阿吉

268
00:16:14,20 --> 00:16:16,40
Do you even know who Kip is?
你知道阿吉是誰嗎？

269
00:16:17,37 --> 00:16:19,81
Who cares? You're Rachel.
誰管他？你是瑞秋

270
00:16:22,14 --> 00:16:23,54
Who's Kip?
阿吉是誰？

271
00:16:23,91 --> 00:16:26,44
My old roommate. We all hung out together.
我以前的室友 以前也跟大家很好

272
00:16:26,65 --> 00:16:28,58
Oh,that poor bastard.
那個可憐人

273
00:16:29,82 --> 00:16:32,95
You told me the story. He and Monica dated.
看吧？你們跟我說過那件事 他以前跟摩妮卡約會

274
00:16:33,22 --> 00:16:37,42
When they broke up,you all promised you'd stay his friend.
分手後卻無法共處一室 你們都答應繼續跟他當朋友 

276
00:16:37,62 --> 00:16:40,25
And what happened? He got phased out.
結果呢？他從此遭到排擠

277
00:16:40,46 --> 00:16:43,12
-You won't be phased out. -Of course I am.
我們才不會排擠你 一定會

278
00:16:43,33 --> 00:16:47,79
It won't happen to Ross. He's your brother,your college roommate.
羅斯一定可以留下來 因為他是你哥哥 又是你大學室友

280
00:16:47,94 --> 00:16:51,00
Kip didn't even have to be Kip. We handled that all wrong.
阿吉也不該受到這樣的待遇 
我們以前處理得很糟糕

282
00:16:51,14 --> 00:16:52,44
It was a long time ago.
況且那是很久以前的事情

283
00:16:52,57 --> 00:16:58,44
And it was before you and me were around. They didn't know what they were doing.
對啊，瑞秋 當時我跟你還沒出現
他們根本不知道自己在做什麼

285
00:16:58,58 --> 00:17:03,04
Chandler had a mustache, for crying out loud.
錢德還留著小鬍子哩

286
00:17:04,05 --> 00:17:06,21
It was just a matter of time.
遲早有人會離開這個小圈圈 

287
00:17:06,45 --> 00:17:09,35
I just assumed Phoebe would be the one to go.
我以前還以為走的是菲比

288
00:17:11,56 --> 00:17:13,96
You live far away, you're not related.
拜託，你住得遠 又不是誰的親戚

289
00:17:14,16 --> 00:17:15,63
You lift right out.
很快就會被淡忘

290
00:17:23,90 --> 00:17:25,46
Hey,Mr. Bing.
賓先生

291
00:17:25,91 --> 00:17:28,64
That hotel you stayed at called.
你住的飯店打電話來

292
00:17:29,88 --> 00:17:32,74
Someone left an eyelash curler in your room.
說在你房間撿到睫毛夾

293
00:17:35,38 --> 00:17:37,08
Yes,that was mine.
是我的

294
00:17:39,15 --> 00:17:41,82
I figured you met a girl and she left it.
我以為你釣上哪個馬子 她忘了帶走

295
00:17:42,49 --> 00:17:44,75
That would have made more sense.
這種說法的確比較合理

296
00:17:45,96 --> 00:17:48,79
I don't even feel like I know you anymore.
我都快要不認識你了

297
00:17:49,83 --> 00:17:53,32
All right,I'm just going to ask you this one time.
我只問你一次就好

298
00:17:53,57 --> 00:17:55,93
Whatever you say, I'll believe you.
無論你怎麼說，我都相信你

299
00:17:57,34 --> 00:18:00,14
Were you or were you not...
你是不是去...

300
00:18:00,34 --> 00:18:01,83
...on a gay cruise?
參加同性戀大會？

301
00:18:16,76 --> 00:18:17,72
菲比

302
00:18:20,99 --> 00:18:23,86
I'm sorry about the whole "lifting out" thing.
我不該說大家會淡忘你

303
00:18:25,97 --> 00:18:27,76
You gotta come with me.
你得跟著我

304
00:18:28,10 --> 00:18:29,54
-Where? -Wherever I go.
去哪裡？ 跟著我就對了

305
00:18:29,80 --> 00:18:33,20
You and me,we'll start a new group. We're the best ones.
我們可以重組一個團體 畢竟我跟你才是精華

306
00:18:37,61 --> 00:18:40,10
Okay,but try to get Joey too.
好吧，不過記得拉喬伊入伙

307
00:18:43,22 --> 00:18:46,45
Phoebe,do you mind if l speak to Rachel alone?
菲比，我可以跟瑞秋 私下談談嗎？

308
00:18:46,69 --> 00:18:47,88
Sure.
當然

309
00:18:50,99 --> 00:18:52,22
Bye,Ross.
再見，羅斯

310
00:18:52,46 --> 00:18:53,89
Forever.
永遠不見了

311
00:18:58,50 --> 00:19:00,49
嗨

312
00:19:00,40 --> 00:19:03,37
Why are you here? Isn't this against the rules?
你來做什麼？這不是違反規定？

314
00:19:06,04 --> 00:19:07,20
I talked to Monica.
我跟摩妮卡談過

315
00:19:10,01 --> 00:19:12,48
Look,I'm the one who made the choice.
是我做這個選擇

316
00:19:12,68 --> 00:19:15,38
I'm the one who's making things change.
我害大家必須要改變

317
00:19:15,65 --> 00:19:19,09
So I should be the one to, you know,step back.
所以離開的應該是我

318
00:19:19,35 --> 00:19:22,32
No,no,it's okay. Really.
羅斯… 真的沒關係

319
00:19:22,62 --> 00:19:26,46
Plenty of people just see their sisters at Thanksgiving...
很多人只有在感恩節見到妹妹 

320
00:19:26,73 --> 00:19:29,39
...their college roommates at reunions...
同學會才見到大學室友

321
00:19:29,63 --> 00:19:32,50
...and Joey at Burger King.
在「漢堡王」才見到喬伊

323
00:19:37,60 --> 00:19:38,66
Is that better?
這樣你舒服一點了嗎？

324
00:19:42,48 --> 00:19:44,27
No,it's not better.
一點也沒有

325
00:19:45,68 --> 00:19:47,84
I still don't get to see you.
我還是見不到你

326
00:19:50,42 --> 00:19:54,11
What would you do? If you were me,what would you do?
瑞秋，換做你會怎麼辦？

328
00:20:02,70 --> 00:20:05,86
First,I'd have said the right name at my wedding.
首先，我在婚禮上 就不會說錯名字

329
00:20:13,21 --> 00:20:14,97
I can't believe this.
竟然得走到這一步

330
00:20:19,21 --> 00:20:20,37
I know.
我知道

331
00:20:21,72 --> 00:20:23,71
I am so sorry.
我很抱歉

332
00:20:25,35 --> 00:20:27,12
I know that too.
我也知道

333
00:20:35,23 --> 00:20:36,22
Hey,Rach?
瑞秋

334
00:20:36,46 --> 00:20:40,87
Sorry to interrupt,but Phoebe said you want to talk to me about a trip?
抱歉打擾 菲比說我們要去哪裡

336
00:20:46,54 --> 00:20:47,70
嘿

337
00:20:49,84 --> 00:20:51,97
I just came over to drop off...
嗨 我來拿…

339
00:20:52,55 --> 00:20:53,84
...nothing.
沒事

340
00:20:58,09 --> 00:20:59,92
So that weekend kind of sucked.
上週末過得很糟

341
00:21:00,65 --> 00:21:01,92
Yeah,it did.
沒錯

342
00:21:02,66 --> 00:21:04,72
So I guess this is over?
那大概沒得玩了

343
00:21:06,93 --> 00:21:10,56
You know,you and me. I mean,it had to end sometime.
什麼？
我說你跟我啦 反正遲早得結束

345
00:21:11,67 --> 00:21:13,10
Why exactly?
為什麼？

346
00:21:13,37 --> 00:21:15,60
Because of the weekend. We had a fight.
因為我們上週末吵架啊

347
00:21:16,44 --> 00:21:18,34
Chandler,that's crazy.
錢德，你太扯了

348
00:21:19,54 --> 00:21:21,77
If you always gave up after a fight...
如果你每次吵架就分手 

349
00:21:22,08 --> 00:21:24,70
...you'd never be with anyone longer than
交往大概不會超過…

350
00:21:25,85 --> 00:21:27,84
難怪

352
00:21:32,05 --> 00:21:33,28
This isn't over?
所以我們還可以繼續？

353
00:21:35,29 --> 00:21:37,09
You are so cute!
你真可愛

354
00:21:39,73 --> 00:21:42,46
No,no. It was a fight.
當然，我們只是吵架

355
00:21:42,70 --> 00:21:46,93
You deal with it and you move on. It's nothing to freak out about.
吵過之後就算了 根本沒什麼好害怕

357
00:21:47,73 --> 00:21:49,36
Really? Okay,great!
真的？太好了

358
00:21:51,81 --> 00:21:54,54
Welcome to an adult relationship.
歡迎加入成熟戀人行列

359
00:21:57,78 --> 00:21:59,75
We're in a relationship?
我們算是男女朋友？

360
00:22:02,32 --> 00:22:03,78
I'm afraid so.
恐怕是

361
00:22:04,62 --> 00:22:05,81
好吧

362
00:22:10,96 --> 00:22:12,72
嘿

363
00:22:12,73 --> 00:22:15,82
I heard you saw Donald Trump at your convention.
摩妮卡，聽說你上周 看到唐納川普

364
00:22:16,10 --> 00:22:18,16
Saw him waiting for an elevator.
對，我看到他在等電梯

365
00:22:21,67 --> 00:22:24,16
Can I use your eyelash curler? I lost mine.
瑞秋，借我睫毛夾 我的不見了

366
00:22:24,40 --> 00:22:25,80
It's in the bathroom.
好啊，在廁所

367
00:22:32,98 --> 00:22:35,17
Can I talk to you for a second?
喬伊，過來一下

368
00:22:48,30 --> 00:22:49,49
Yes.
沒錯…

369
00:22:50,30 --> 00:22:51,59
Yes.

370
00:22:52,83 --> 00:22:54,16
You?
你？

371
00:22:54,30 --> 00:22:55,43
And you?
跟你？

372
00:22:56,67 --> 00:22:59,10
But you cannot tell anyone. No one knows.
對，但是你不能告訴別人 還沒人知道

373
00:22:59,34 --> 00:23:01,17
But how? When?
怎麼會？何時？

374
00:23:01,68 --> 00:23:04,01
-lt happened in London. -ln London!
要從倫敦說起 倫敦？

376
00:23:06,71 --> 00:23:10,48
We didn't want to make a big deal out of it.
我們之所以沒告訴大家 是不想你們大驚小怪

377
00:23:10,72 --> 00:23:14,38
But it is a big deal! I have to tell someone!
這的確是大事 我非告訴誰不可

380
00:23:16,22 --> 00:23:17,25
You can't.
不行…你不能說

381
00:23:17,39 --> 00:23:21,73
-Please. Now,I know this is hard. -lt is. It hurts.
我知道這很痛苦 沒錯，痛苦死了

383
00:23:24,16 --> 00:23:27,19
We just don't want to deal with telling everyone.
拜託你，我們就是 不想面對大家質問

384
00:23:27,40 --> 00:23:29,87
Please just promise you won't tell.
求求你保證不說

385
00:23:33,44 --> 00:23:34,67
All right.
好吧

386
00:23:36,58 --> 00:23:39,01
Man,this is unbelievable!
不可思議

387
00:23:39,25 --> 00:23:41,11
I mean,it's great!
這是件好事

388
00:23:41,35 --> 00:23:42,94
But....
可是…

389
00:23:43,18 --> 00:23:44,45
I know. It's great!
我知道，的確很棒

390
00:23:46,05 --> 00:23:48,18
I don't want to see that!
我可不想看到這一幕

391
00:23:51,53 --> 00:23:53,39
We're so stupid.
我們真是太蠢了

392
00:23:54,03 --> 00:23:58,19
Do you know what's going on in there? They're trying to take Joey!
你知道他們在做什麼嗎？他們想搶走喬伊

394
00:24:03,24 --> 00:24:07,37
"The most popular Phoebe in tennis is called the overhand Phoebe.
網球界最有名的菲比 就叫做殺球菲比

395
00:24:07,74 --> 00:24:12,14
If you win,slap your opponent on the Phoebe and say,'Hi,Phoebe!'"
贏了就得跟對方擊掌 說「嗨，菲比」

396
00:24:13,05 --> 00:24:15,88
That's cute. We really all enjoyed it.
真有意思，很好玩

397
00:24:16,18 --> 00:24:18,21
-But it doesn't count. -For what?
但是這不算 不算什麼？

398
00:24:18,39 --> 00:24:21,79
Just count in our heads as good Mad Libs.
這可不算瘋狂字謎

400
00:24:23,16 --> 00:24:25,12
-I gotta go. -Fun's over.
我不想玩了 不好玩了

401
00:24:25,79 --> 00:24:27,95
Wait,if we follow the rules...
等等，要遵守規則

402
00:24:28,16 --> 00:24:30,49
...it's still fun and it means something.
才有意思 也才有意義啊

403
00:24:30,73 --> 00:24:32,10
I'm going to take off.
我要閃人了

404
00:24:32,30 --> 00:24:34,39
Guys,rules are good!
有規則才好 

405
00:24:34,63 --> 00:24:36,60
Rules help control the fun.
不守規則怎麼會好玩

406
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00


407
00:00:00,00 --> 00:00:00,00

